[b]Reference checks and original machinery[/b]

An authentic anvil provides a small reconstruction check; the comparison labels the reference and the independently built candidate. The riveting station and screw press are original designs. A successful export or silhouette score is not artistic approval.

[i]Prepared native comparison — Authentic Jagex anvil on the left; independently authored reconstruction on the right. Same native camera and light.[/i]
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/autismoyah-hub/project-gielinor-showcase/83e1b40d52b34bcbe50b5d9662f5a61a37bb2282/images/custom-models/04-anvil-reference.png[/img]

