[b]Organic forms and authored motion[/b]

Cindermaw uses a more developed anatomical mesh and custom action groups. The clay image is a Blender diagnostic; the still and animations that follow come from the native renderer. Joint transitions, stance and foot contact remain areas to improve.

[i]Blender diagnostic render — Cindermaw in Blender clay lighting: a construction diagnostic, not a native appearance.[/i]
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/autismoyah-hub/project-gielinor-showcase/83e1b40d52b34bcbe50b5d9662f5a61a37bb2282/images/custom-models/15-clay-construction.png[/img]

[i]Prepared native render — Cindermaw after refinement, through the native renderer.[/i]
