[b]Working from an original 2D reference[/b]

Ashhorn tests a different approach: retain an original AI-generated turnaround and rebuild against its front, side and quarter views. The earlier interpretation and later static reconstruction below share the same native quarter camera. The face, plate hierarchy and anatomy still fall short of the illustration; this study has no animation or playable encounter.

[i]AI concept illustration — Ashhorn: the preserved AI-generated turnaround used as an original design reference.[/i]
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/autismoyah-hub/project-gielinor-showcase/83e1b40d52b34bcbe50b5d9662f5a61a37bb2282/images/custom-models/19-concept-reference.png[/img]

