Authentic-asset studies also exposed failures. The Fire Giant club-variant test reached a static comparison and a separate corrected motion retest after the first motion attempt failed; it does not establish a finished original NPC or independently authored choreography. Convincing organic creatures and consistent high artistic fidelity remain active research problems.

The pipeline is increasingly useful for structures and machinery. We are still learning how to make creature shapes, faces, materials and motion feel authored rather than procedural. Thanks for looking — criticism of the native results is especially welcome.

[i]Only review images and original animation previews are included here. Authentic anvil imagery is credited to Jagex; no cache meshes or extracted reference animations are distributed. RuneScape / OSRS belongs to Jagex. Unofficial project, unaffiliated with Jagex.[/i]
